{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026W3rpUFJCaf1795423233.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>私隱專員公署憑打擊「起底」工作，獲環球私隱議會頒發執法大獎。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PCPD-1400_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026m27fM4CUyS1795417431.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>頒獎禮早前在比利時布魯塞爾第48屆環球私隱議會會議期間舉行。今年入圍最後六強的包括加拿大、愛爾蘭、肯尼亞及意大利私隱監管機構，最終由香港私隱專員公署奪得「爭議解決及執法」大獎。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PCPD-1400_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ey3AgIF8zv1795417426.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>私隱專員鍾麗玲表示，獎項肯定香港在打擊非法「起底」方面努力，公署會繼續果斷執法，加強保障市民個人資料。她又與多國監管機構，以及META和騰訊等科技公司代表交流。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.696337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:15.560692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:16.637795+00:00","content_hash":"849fac49daf9dea1ce36b8ca3ced96c9e2165b196a260bd436f04e2d0d15a889","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.696337+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}